      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِرْعَةٌ</span></b>  a subst. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِخْتَرَعَ الشَّىْءَ</span> signifying
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِرْتَجَلَهُ</span> [&amp;c.; app. meaning <i>A thing done,</i> or
